<title>UK: Mentmore has 90.74 pct acceptances for BDM.</title>
<headline>Mentmore has 90.74 pct acceptances for BDM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mentmore Abbey Plc said on Friday that it had received acceptances for its offer for British Data Management Plc (BDM) from shareholders representing 90.74 percent of the company.</p>
<p>Mentmore Abbey reported that as of 1400 GMT, the first close for the offer, acceptances had been received for 22,640,419 of BDM's ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The recommended offer has been extended until October 18.</p>
<p>Mentmore's bid valued BDM at 42.55 million stg.</p>
